UDAAN 2025 - SGSITS INDORE DRESS CODE GUIDELINES

MALE CANDIDATES:
- White or Off-White Kurta Pyjama.
- Ceremonial Half-Jacket (Provided at Registration Counter).

FEMALE CANDIDATES:
- White or Off-White Salwar Kurta or Saree.
- Ceremonial Half-Jacket (Provided at Registration Counter).

NOTE:
Strict decorum must be maintained. Footwear should be formal traditional.
